---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="Welcome" description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>What is in a kickout?</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome to the "What is in a kickout?" blog, where I aim to discuss what makes a good kickout in professional wrestling where I will go into detail for one of wrestlings biggest kickouts in history, from the buildup in the weeks prior, what occured on the day and its significance to the viewer.
			</p>
			<p>
			In order to see the narrative unfold, click into the "Blog" section, which you can see at the top of this page. Enjoy, and thanks for visiting!
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
